      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "CP0X",
        "Description": "1x2 MMI Splitter copy gate (input A, outputs Y1 and Y2, threshold 0.375) built from the Demo PDK\u0027s MMI splitter. Role in the 2-bit program counter: the second fan-out stage of C0, feeding the XOR pivot X and the C0 arm R of the high bit\u0027s increment. The whole PC composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
